Spec: Explicit first-trial deployment

Purpose:
  Deploy the frozen trial to the operator's existing ECS, Windows and connected Android without migrating legacy applications.

Owns:
  ./DEPLOYMENT.md

Must:
  Treat the operator's deployment request as explicit operational authority, distinct from prior local-only development.
  Verify the configured ECS identity, existing services, SSH host identity and exact package hashes before changing the host.
  Preserve the new trial identity/service, ReDesk and shared STUN; retire only the operator-authorized obsolete LinkGate installation after verifying its ownership and preserving a private recovery archive.
  Keep all generated identities, cloud command receipts, temporary transfer credentials and local process ownership records under ignored private deployment directories.
  Use stable saved cloud operation receipts and inspect unknown outcomes before retrying; remove only the exact temporary transfer authorization created for this deployment.
  Leave device private keys on their originating device and require explicit local and server application grants.
  Verify one bounded real cloud data transfer and normal stop/restart; do not repeat long stability or physical network matrices.
  Install Android through authorized ADB only; leave phone screen and owner confirmation to the user.
